  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116448",
      "title": "Setting Query Parameters",
      "lectureOrder": 286,
      "videoOrder": 273,
      "sourceHash": "897142cd4b1eff414ea37158bf80c24878bc3d24f250c56bd67f44d49ea2029d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 3.93,
          "en": "Now, with that, in this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.93,
          "end": 6.27,
          "en": "I'd like to add a new feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.27,
          "end": 10.26,
          "en": "Here, when I output these tasks, I'd like to add a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.26,
          "end": 13.89,
          "en": "or a button above these tasks that allows me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.89,
          "end": 17.67,
          "en": "to change the order of these tasks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.67,
          "end": 21.45,
          "en": "so that we either have the most recently added tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.45,
          "end": 25.47,
          "en": "at the top, or that we have the oldest tasks at the top,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.47,
          "end": 28.95,
          "en": "so the tasks that have been added in the past.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.95,
          "end": 33.95,
          "en": "And to add this feature, we can go to this tasks component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.8,
          "end": 37.74,
          "en": "and then there, above that unordered list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.74,
          "end": 40.983,
          "en": "I'll simply add a paragraph with an anchor tag in it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.91,
          "end": 45.81,
          "en": "where we say, Sort Ascending, or Descending,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.81,
          "end": 48.63,
          "en": "depending on what we're currently doing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.63,
          "end": 50.86,
          "en": "and we can then use routerLink",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.99,
          "end": 54.51,
          "en": "to link to the page we're currently on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.51,
          "end": 56.223,
          "en": "by using this notation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.06,
          "end": 60.36,
          "en": "That's another special syntax understood by Angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.36,
          "end": 63.72,
          "en": "which essentially tells Angular that you wanna stay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.72,
          "end": 65.82,
          "en": "on the page where you are,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.82,
          "end": 68.03999999999999,
          "en": "or that you wanna construct a path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.03999999999999,
          "end": 71.25,
          "en": "that starts at the current page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.25,
          "end": 74.67,
          "en": "You could then add more to it, but here, I'll just use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.67,
          "end": 76.713,
          "en": "to stay on the page where I am.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.88,
          "end": 79.11,
          "en": "Because we can then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.11,
          "end": 82.47,
          "en": "also use another routing-related feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.47,
          "end": 87.45,
          "en": "We can use queryParams for controlling the order",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.45,
          "end": 89.67,
          "en": "of our tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.67,
          "end": 92.25,
          "en": "Because of course, we could add a button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.25,
          "end": 95.31,
          "en": "and we could then connect this button to a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.31,
          "end": 97.71000000000001,
          "en": "and use a signal to update our order.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.71000000000001,
          "end": 99.33,
          "en": "We could do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.33,
          "end": 103.08,
          "en": "but using query parameters has the advantage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.08,
          "end": 105.12,
          "en": "that will get a shareable link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.12,
          "end": 108.87,
          "en": "because query parameters are these extra pieces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.87,
          "end": 112.68,
          "en": "of information which you can add to your URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.68,
          "end": 114.99000000000001,
          "en": "They come after such a question mark,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.99000000000001,
          "end": 117.50999999999999,
          "en": "and you can then add any key value pairs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.50999999999999,
          "end": 118.713,
          "en": "of your choice here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.27,
          "end": 124.17,
          "en": "And Angular's Router gives you features that make it easy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.17,
          "end": 126.363,
          "en": "to add query parameters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.23,
          "end": 128.55,
          "en": "but at the same time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.55,
          "end": 131.22,
          "en": "the Angular Router also helps you when it comes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.22,
          "end": 135.45,
          "en": "to extracting and using these query parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.45,
          "end": 139.47,
          "en": "We can then therefore use this query parameter feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.47,
          "end": 144.47,
          "en": "to dynamically recalculate, if you wanna call it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.54,
          "end": 147.96,
          "en": "our tasks, especially when we're using a signal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.96,
          "end": 151.74,
          "en": "but even without that, as you will also see later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.74,
          "end": 155.25,
          "en": "Now, in order to use the routerLink directive here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.25,
          "end": 157.773,
          "en": "we must go to the TasksComponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.39,
          "end": 163.82999999999998,
          "en": "and there in the imports array, add routerLink,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.82999999999998,
          "end": 166.023,
          "en": "as we did it multiple times before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.9,
          "end": 172.89,
          "en": "With that done, we can add the routerLink directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.89,
          "end": 176.46,
          "en": "and with that added, we can also add queryParams,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.46,
          "end": 180.24,
          "en": "which simplifies the process of adding query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.24,
          "end": 183.693,
          "en": "to the URL this link will lead to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.74,
          "end": 186.84,
          "en": "Now for that queryParams,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 186.84,
          "end": 189.78,
          "en": "this input actually wants an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 189.78,
          "end": 192.3,
          "en": "so we must use property binding here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 192.3,
          "end": 196.56,
          "en": "to pass an object to this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 196.56,
          "end": 198.66,
          "en": "And this object then allows you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 198.66,
          "end": 201.6,
          "en": "to define any key value pairs of your choice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 201.6,
          "end": 205.29,
          "en": "and these will be the key value pairs that will be encoded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.29,
          "end": 208.353,
          "en": "as query parameters in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 209.7,
          "end": 210.66,
          "en": "So for example, here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 210.66,
          "end": 213.6,
          "en": "we could add a query parameter named order,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 213.6,
          "end": 216.21,
          "en": "though this name is entirely up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 216.21,
          "end": 218.373,
          "en": "and set this to asc.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 219.87,
          "end": 224.4,
          "en": "And with that, if you save that, you would have a link here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 224.4,
          "end": 226.71,
          "en": "and we'll take care of styling in a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 226.71,
          "end": 228.36,
          "en": "and if you click that link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 228.36,
          "end": 233.313,
          "en": "you see this order=asc query parameter was added here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.32999999999998,
          "end": 237.69,
          "en": "Then go to a user that doesn't have any query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 237.69,
          "end": 241.08,
          "en": "in the URL yet, and I click that link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 241.08,
          "end": 244.083,
          "en": "you see this here was added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 246.54,
          "end": 248.52,
          "en": "So that's working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.52,
          "end": 250.56,
          "en": "Now to fix the styling real quick,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.56,
          "end": 253.8,
          "en": "we can go to the tasks component CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 253.8,
          "end": 257.1,
          "en": "and in there, I'll add a very simple CSS rule,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 257.1,
          "end": 259.38,
          "en": "which we can quickly write together,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 259.38,
          "end": 263.16,
          "en": "where we can target anchor elements in that component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 263.16,
          "end": 265.83,
          "en": "set text-decoration to none,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 265.83,
          "end": 268.39,
          "en": "and give them a color of #c6a7ed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 275.52,
          "end": 277.62,
          "en": "And of course, you can use any styling you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 277.62,
          "end": 281.31,
          "en": "but that will ensure that the link looks a bit nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 281.31,
          "end": 285.96,
          "en": "And we can actually now also add a second rule here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 285.96,
          "end": 288.93,
          "en": "to make sure that if the link is hovered or active,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 288.93,
          "end": 292.14,
          "en": "we change the color by copying the color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 292.14,
          "end": 295.2,
          "en": "and then I'll use the color picker in Visual Studio Code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 295.2,
          "end": 297.663,
          "en": "to pick a slightly darker shade.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 301.74,
          "end": 303.273,
          "en": "Yeah, so that looks better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 304.38,
          "end": 306.45,
          "en": "But with that, we got this link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 306.45,
          "end": 309,
          "en": "that is setting the query parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 309,
          "end": 313.35,
          "en": "but at the moment, it's always setting it to asc.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 313.35,
          "end": 315.66,
          "en": "And that, of course, should be dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 315.66,
          "end": 319.38,
          "en": "It should be set to asc if it's currently not set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 319.38,
          "end": 322.92,
          "en": "or set to descending, and vice versa,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 322.92,
          "end": 325.413,
          "en": "and this text here also should be updated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 326.37,
          "end": 328.05,
          "en": "And to do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 328.05,
          "end": 332.28,
          "en": "we need to get the current query parameter value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 332.28,
          "end": 333.963,
          "en": "So that will be the next step.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
